{"id": "q003", "pooled": [{"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "research", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "research", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_improvements", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_improvements", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_improvements", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_improvements", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_construction_help", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "account_deletion", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 7}], "relevant": [{"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 2}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Puedes aportar bitcoins haciendo un depósito voluntario en la tesorería de alianza (pestaña Banco, opción «Dar»). Luego, cualquier miembro puede solicitar un retiro; si tiene el permiso Modificar (o en una alianza del Baluarte Silencioso), el retiro es inmediato, y si no, un miembro con ese permiso debe validarlo. Cada movimiento queda registrado en el historial del banco.", "new_answer_fr": "Vous pouvez apporter des bitcoins en effectuant un dépôt volontaire dans la trésorerie de l'alliance (onglet Banque, option « Donner »). Ensuite, n'importe quel membre peut demander un retrait ; s'il a la permission Modifier (ou dans une alliance du Bastion Silencieux), le retrait est immédiat, sinon un membre ayant cette permission doit le valider. Chaque mouvement est consigné dans l'historique de la banque.", "kind": "multi_section", "note": "Les sections S11, S17, S18 et S19 confirment exactement l'ancienne réponse ; aucun changement détecté."}
{"id": "q022", "pooled": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "reports", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "planet_abandon", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "political_system", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "political_system", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "cthulhu_prophecies", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "cthulhu_prophecies", "section_index": 6}], "relevant": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "reports", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 3}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Behalte täglich deine Bilanz (Einnahmen minus Kosten) im Auge und reagiere, wenn sie ins Minus rutscht. Stelle ungenutzte Flotten am Boden ab (Unterhalt wird durch 6 geteilt), rekrutiere nicht zu viel und halte immer mindestens zwei Planeten verteidigungsbereit. Beobachte anrückende feindliche Flotten und evakuiere bei großer Gefahr Truppen und Ressourcen auf einen sicheren Planeten.", "new_answer_fr": "Gardez un œil quotidien sur votre bilan (revenus moins coûts) et réagissez s'il passe dans le rouge. Posez les flottes inutilisées au sol (entretien divisé par 6), ne recrutez pas trop et gardez toujours au moins deux planètes prêtes à se défendre. Surveillez les flottes ennemies en approche et, en cas de grand danger, évacuez troupes et ressources vers une planète sûre.", "kind": "procedural", "note": "Les sections actuelles confirment et précisent les conseils de l'ancienne réponse, notamment la division par 6 de l'entretien des flottes au sol."}
{"id": "q064", "pooled": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "reports", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "notifications", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "notifications", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "invasion", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "combat_stats", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "galaxy_navigation", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "political_system", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "political_system", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "salon", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "salon", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "prison_escape", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "game_modes", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_arena", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 5}], "relevant": [{"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 2}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Va dans la page Alliance, onglet Pactos (« Diplomacia da aliança »). Dans « Propor », saisis le tag de l'alliance cible et choisis Aliança defensiva, Pacto de nao-agressao ou Declarar guerra. L'autre alliance voit ta demande dans « Pedidos recebidos » et peut l'accepter ou la refuser. Il n'y a pas de contre-proposition.", "new_answer_fr": "Va dans la page Alliance, onglet Pactos (« Diplomacia da aliança »). Dans « Propor », saisis le tag de l'alliance cible et choisis Aliança defensiva, Pacto de nao-agressao ou Declarar guerra. L'autre alliance voit ta demande dans « Pedidos recebidos » et peut l'accepter ou la refuser. Il n'y a pas de contre-proposition.", "kind": "procedural", "note": ""}
