{"id": "q084", "pooled": [{"slug": "tips", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "reports", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "colonization", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "planet_abandon", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "alliance_grades", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "salon", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "achievements", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "achievements", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_arena", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_arena", "section_index": 10}, {"slug": "cthulhu_prophecies", "section_index": 7}], "relevant": [{"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 6}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "To create your own alliance, your account must be validated and your e-mail confirmed. Open your Alliance page from the menu and choose a name (20 characters max, unique), a tag (5 characters max, unique), a rallying cry (30 characters), a description (1,500 characters), the alliance tax (5-50%, final), and the political regime (final). You become the alliance leader and the treasury starts empty.", "new_answer_fr": "Pour créer votre propre alliance, votre compte doit être validé et votre e-mail confirmé. Ouvrez votre page Alliance depuis le menu et choisissez un nom (20 caractères max, unique), un tag (5 caractères max, unique), un cri de ralliement (30 caractères), une description (1 500 caractères), la taxe d'alliance (5-50 %, définitive) et le régime politique (définitif). Vous devenez le chef de l'alliance et la trésorerie démarre vide.", "kind": "procedural", "note": "Les sections S7 et S12 confirment les étapes et conditions ; l'ancienne réponse est toujours exacte, avec des précisions sur les longueurs du cri et de la description."}
{"id": "q116", "pooled": [{"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "exchange", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "political_system", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "salon", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "items", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "cthulhu_prophecies", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "alliance_improvements", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "faq", "section_index": 6}], "relevant": [{"slug": "alliance_treasury", "section_index": 0}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "The alliance treasury is used to raise the alliance level (to welcome more members and unlock political researches) and to redistribute Bitcoins or War Points to a member, such as helping out a player in trouble or funding war preparation.", "new_answer_fr": "La trésorerie d'alliance sert à augmenter le niveau de l'alliance (pour accueillir plus de membres et débloquer des recherches politiques) et à redistribuer des Bitcoins ou des points de guerre à un membre, par exemple pour aider un joueur en difficulté ou financer la préparation d'une guerre.", "kind": "factual", "note": ""}
{"id": "q165", "pooled": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "interface_guide", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources_intro", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "tips", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "resources", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "buildings", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "buildings", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "workers_scientists", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "recycling", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "ship_types", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "embargo", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "planet_management", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "moon", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "alliance_research", "section_index": 1}], "relevant": [{"slug": "bitcoin_economy", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "daily_report", "section_index": 3}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Se após o balanço diário seu saldo de Bitcoins ficar negativo, ocorre o Game Over econômico: todas as suas frotas são suprimidas (em voo e em órbita, com carga e tropas a bordo), todas as naves em solo dos seus planetas são perdidas e seu saldo volta para 125.000 Bitcoins. Você mantém seus planetas, edifícios, defesas, pesquisas e as tropas que ficaram em solo.", "new_answer_fr": "Si après le bilan quotidien votre solde de Bitcoins devient négatif, c'est le Game Over économique : toutes vos flottes sont supprimées (en vol et en orbite, avec cargaison et troupes à bord), tous les vaisseaux au sol de vos planètes sont perdus et votre solde revient à 125 000 Bitcoins. Vous conservez vos planètes, bâtiments, défenses, recherches et les troupes restées au sol.", "kind": "multi_section", "note": "La réponse est identique dans les sections S8 et S24, aucune modification nécessaire."}
{"id": "q232", "pooled": [{"slug": "getting_started", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "first_combat", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "glossary", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "market", "section_index": 6}, {"slug": "ship_types", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "ship_customization", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "ship_customization", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "spatial_combat", "section_index": 7}, {"slug": "invasion", "section_index": 8}, {"slug": "defense", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "defense", "section_index": 5}, {"slug": "alliance_basics", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "diplomacy", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "leveling", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 1}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "ranking", "section_index": 0}, {"slug": "ranking", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "arena", "section_index": 3}, {"slug": "game_over", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "achievements", "section_index": 2}, {"slug": "alliance_arena", "section_index": 4}, {"slug": "cthulhu_prophecies", "section_index": 7}], "relevant": [{"slug": "war_points", "section_index": 3}], "answerable": true, "question_valid": true, "old_answer": "consistent", "renamed_terms": [], "new_answer": "Yes, you can lose War Points by spending them, by being eliminated (your last planet invaded), or by paying a peace tax if your alliance accepted a peace that pays a tribute in WP. Losing a combat or an economic bankruptcy does not take WP away.", "new_answer_fr": "Oui, vous pouvez perdre des points de guerre en les dépensant, en étant éliminé (votre dernière planète envahie), ou en payant un tribut de paix si votre alliance a accepté une paix qui paie un tribut en WP. Perdre un combat ou une faillite économique ne retire pas de WP.", "kind": "factual", "note": ""}
